# Files go-mcp-template shares with the repos made from it. One per line: <kind> <path>.
#
#   owned    The template's copy wins. Repos change it here, in the template.
#   seeded   The repo owns it after creation. Sync applies the template's changes by hand.
#   retired  No longer used. Sync deletes it from repos that still have it.
#
# To stop sharing a file, move its line to `retired` rather than deleting it, so repos
# that synced it get told to remove it.

owned .claude/settings.json
owned docs/process.md
owned docs/decisions/000-template.md
owned docs/specs/000-template.md
owned .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature.md
owned .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug.md
owned .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
owned .github/dependabot.yml
owned .github/workflows/security.yml
owned .github/workflows/template-sync.yml
owned .github/template-manifest
owned .github/template-sync.md
owned .github/FUNDING.yml
owned cliff.toml

seeded CLAUDE.md
seeded .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml
seeded .golangci.yml
seeded .gitignore

# The vault-based standards process this template replaced.
retired .claude/skills/creating-issue
retired .claude/skills/working-issue
retired .claude/skills/syncing-standards
retired .claude/skills/proposing-standard
